/edgemix
/dist/
*.log
*.log.gz
/cover.out
/coverage.html
# A profile is a map of somebody's infrastructure — hostnames, real routes,
# build hashes. Emitted profiles stay out of this repository.
/*.profile.json
/profile.json
.DS_Store

# The rendered documentation site. It is generated from docs/ by
# scripts/site.sh on every deploy, so it is never committed.
/_site/

# The example log is written by hand for docs/example.md, not captured from
# anywhere, and every number on that page is checked against it. It is
# documentation, so it survives the *.log rule above.
!/docs/example.log
